/*

	BUGS:
	 - The box saying "press 2 to start mission" doesn't show up
	 - Sometimes the GPS marker doesn't show up
	 - Race markers don't show up (should show a circle)
	 - There is no feedback for hitting / missing (functions added)
	 - There is no actual payouts yet
	 - Variables need to be moved into PlayerVar and properly reset
	 - Make it so every bike can be used for this, (incl motorcycles), not just BMX


	TODO:
	- Three types (newspaper, paper package, box package, see models Ryhes in Env Discord)
	- When you successfully land a package, pay out $15 to $50 depending on type.
	- If you miss a package, give a failure sound and inform them of it (no payout)
	- After finishing a job without missing a single hit, give a $150 bonus!

	Add 5 newspaper stands around each area. 
		- These cost 5 to 10k (randomized).
		- Players can own these for 168 hours (1 week time), each paycheck decreases the time.
		- Players can pay a 5k fee to extend the ownership by 168 hours.
		- Players can own these to earn $250-500 every paycheck (randomized)

*/

